A note on this project, since it handles sensitive data.

The code is released for study, review and contribution. It is not presented as
production-ready clinical software, and it has not been through the regulatory
process (HIPAA, EU MDR, or local equivalents) that software making treatment
decisions about identifiable people requires. See SECURITY.md for how to report a
vulnerability rather than disclosing it in a public issue.
